# Mutant Dog

## Lore

The mutant canines of the Coalition States are the genetic engineering
laboratories'' most successful creation: dogs raised to human intelligence,
walking upright, with senses no human can match and an instinct for psychic
energy, magic and the supernatural. Most serve in the Coalition Dog Packs;
a few are deserters or the free-born children of deserters.

This is the race. What the dog learned is the occupation paired with it: the
Dog Boy O.C.C. of the Dog Packs, the NTSET Psi-Hound, or another occupation
that takes a mutant dog.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'mutant-dog');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
-- these, and a CR in the stored markdown means the checkout mangled the file.
SELECT class_id, name, status, length(markdown) AS bytes, instr(markdown, char(13)) > 0 AS has_cr
  FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'mutant-dog';

